# Line endings that work on every computer. Without these, git on Windows can turn the
# shell scripts' line endings into CRLF, and `./gradlew`, `tools/check.sh` or the server's
# Docker entrypoint then fail with "bad interpreter" (Git Bash, WSL, Docker).
gradlew   text eol=lf
*.sh      text eol=lf
*.bat     text eol=crlf
*.cmd     text eol=crlf
*.jar     binary
